# Li readability (org)

When editing **Li source or docs** in any repo (`lic`, packages, benchmarks samples):

- **Canonical rule:** `lic/.cursor/rules/li-readability-philosophy.mdc`
- **Canonical doc:** `lic/docs/language/philosophy.md` (if `lic` is checked out)

**Summary:** Code does what it reads like it does (Python-style). Use `import physics.runtime`, verb `proc` names (`step_world`), nouns for types (`Body`), no `li_std_*` in examples.
